GH Çalıştay
===========

This project is a customized distribution of Kanboard.

Original project: https://github.com/kanboard/kanboard
Original author: Frédéric Guillot and Kanboard contributors
Original license: MIT (see LICENSE)

Modifications for Global Hukukçular Derneği:
- GH Çalıştay branding, Turkish landing/login/membership pages
- Membership application and administrator approval workflow
- Private e-Devlet document storage and download
- Custom theme, assets and Turkish locale additions
- Docker/Caddy deployment files

The Kanboard name, logo and upstream assets remain subject to their original
licenses and attribution. Global Hukukçular Derneği name, logo and corporate
content are trademarks of the association and are not covered by the MIT
